@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics for Clients" as FAFR003
  usecase "CFR002: Receive Alerts on Anomalous Transactions" as CFR002
  usecase "SAFR006: Manage Personalized Recommendations Preferences" as SAFR006
  usecase "SFR019: Maintain Historical Record of Insights" as SFR019
  usecase "AIFR003: Generate Spending Limit Alerts Based on Patterns" as AIFR003

  Client --> CFR001 : View financial data and insights.
  Client --> CFR002 : Receive alerts about anomalous transactions.
  Client --> FAFR003 : Review predictive analytics for clients.
  Client --> SAFR006 : Adjust personalized recommendation preferences.

  SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Configure analysis parameters in the system.

  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR002: View client intervention alerts.
  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR004: Customize analysis parameters by segment.
  
  System --> AIFR003: Request spending limit alerts for user monitoring.
}

@enduml